  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to improve the literacy and life skills of socially and economically disadvantaged and marginalized out-of-school youth (80 percent girls and young women). These basic education and vocational/job training will increase the access of youth to economic opportunities.</narrative>
